# Installed dependencies. The plugin resolves them from the profile, and the
# server installs its own; neither belongs in the repository. Note the bare
# `node_modules` form: the plugin's is a symlink here, and a trailing slash only
# matches directories, so the symlink would otherwise be committed.
node_modules
*.tgz
# Release checksum written next to the tarball by the packaging step.
*.tgz.sha256
.DS_Store

# Local secrets. `claude-server/.gitignore` covers its own env files; these
# entries catch anything created at the root by accident.
.env
.env.local
.env.server
*.pem

# Development-process notes: these record one operator's environment (private
# Docker subnets, gateway addresses, measured account data, instruction logs) and
# are not part of the published project. The READMEs carry what a user needs.
CONSTRAINTS.md
PLAN-claude-server.md
